{"title":"San Diego Math Circle","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>San Diego Math Circle</b> (<b>SDMC</b>) was started by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Richard_Rusczyk\" title=\"Richard Rusczyk\">Richard Rusczyk</a> in 2003.  There are currently around 200 students who participate.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Competitions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Hosted_Contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Hosted Contests</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Resources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Resources</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Competitions\">Competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_Circle&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>SDMC students compete in a variety of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">mathematics competitions</a> to sharpen their skills.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Students from the SDMC form the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_ARML\" title=\"San Diego ARML\">San Diego ARML</a> team to compete at the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=American_Regions_Mathematics_League\" title=\"American Regions Mathematics League\">American Regions Mathematics League</a> (ARML).</li>\n<li>The past two winners of the San Diego chapter of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathCounts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MathCounts\">MathCounts</a> have been SDMC students.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Hosted_Contests\">Hosted Contests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_Circle&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Hosted Contests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The SDMC hosts \n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_League\" title=\"San Diego Math League\">San Diego Math League</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_Olympiad\" title=\"San Diego Math Olympiad\">San Diego Math Olympiad</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_Circle&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.sdmathcircle.org\">SDMC Homepage</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_Circle&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_circles\" title=\"Math circles\">Math circles</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=California_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"California mathematics competitions\">California mathematics competitions</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018105828\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 19/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1483:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018105828 and revision id 26408. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}